<div class="bg-color-tutorial">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="row justify-content-center text-white pt-1 pb-3">
      <div class="text-center py-4">
        <h1 class="fw-bold">チュートリアル</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="col-11 col-sm-10 col-lg-9 mb-5">
        <h2 class="text-center font-monospace">STEP1</h2>
        <h2 class="text-center font-monospace fs-xlarge fs-md-xxlarge fw-bold mb-4">手拍子(パルマ)の叩き方紹介</h2>
        <div class="card rounded bg-color border card-shadow-dark border-white border-1 text-white py-2 px-sm-2 p-md-4">
          <div class="card-body mb-3">
            <h4 class="card-title border-bottom border-3 fw-semibold fs-large fs-sm-larger fs-md-xlarge">1. パルマとは？</h4>
            <div class="card-text lh-sm fs-lg-larger pt-2 pe-3 pe-sm-4">
              <ul>
                <li><p class="mb-2">手拍子を表します。</p></li>
                <li><p class="mb-2">ソルダ（低い音）/セコ（高い音）の二種類の叩き方があります。</p></li>
                <li><p>本場スペインでは手拍子専門のアーティスト(パルメーロ)がいるほど、フラメンコを支える重要な役割を担っています。</p></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title border-bottom border-3 fw-semibold fs-large fs-sm-larger fs-md-xlarge">2. 叩き方紹介</h4>
            <div class="row pt-2 px-sm-3 px-xxl-0">
              <div class="col me-lg-3">
                <h5 class="card-text fs-large fs-md-larger fs-lg-xlarge pt-4">ソルダ（低い音）</h5>
                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9">
                  <iframe class="rounded" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UHfeQC1aL1Y" title="YouTube video" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <%# <iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UHfeQC1aL1Y" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe> %>
              </div>
              <div class="w-100 d-xxl-none pt-3"></div>
              <div class="col">
                <h5 class="card-text fs-large fs-md-larger fs-lg-xlarge pt-4">セコ（高い音）</h5>
                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 ">
                  <iframe class="rounded" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/32uA1pBfG38" title="YouTube video" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <%# <iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/32uA1pBfG38" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe> %>
              </div>
              <div class="card-text text-center pt-4 pb-1 mt-3">
                <p class="fs-md-larger fs-xl-xlarge mb-0">ソルダ(低い音)の方が簡単に叩くことができます。<br>好きな叩き方を真似てみましょう！</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-11 col-sm-10 col-xxl-8 font-monospace my-3 my-lg-5 pb-4 pb-lg-5">
        <h2 class="text-center">STEP2</h2>
        <h2 class="text-center fs-xlarge fs-md-xxlarge fw-bold mb-2 mb-lg-3">音に合わせてパルマ(手拍子)を録音</h2>
        <p class="text-center text-white fs-sm-large mb-4">パルマを叩いて録音してみよう!</p>
        <div class="row flex-column flex-lg-row align-items-center justify-content-lg-center">
          <div class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2 mb-lg-4">
            <p class="text-white border-bottom border-2 fs-larger fs-md-xlarge fs-lg-xxlarge mb-2">初級☆</p>
            <%= render "layouts/guest_tutorial/level_btn", {btn_name: "テンポに合わせて叩こう", level_name: "easy" }%>
          </div>
          <div class="w-100 d-none d-lg-block"></div>
          <div class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2 me-lg-5">
            <p class="text-white border-bottom border-2 fs-larger fs-md-xlarge fs-lg-xxlarge mb-2">中級☆☆</p>
            <%= render "layouts/guest_tutorial/level_btn", {btn_name: "リズムに合わせて叩こう", level_name: "normal" }%>
          </div>
          <div class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2 ms-lg-5">
            <p class="text-white border-bottom border-2 fs-larger fs-md-xlarge fs-lg-xxlarge mb-2">上級☆☆☆</p>
            <%= render "layouts/guest_tutorial/level_btn", {btn_name: "メロディーに合わせて叩こう", level_name: "hard" }%>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
